    "description": "## Router nima?\nAiogram 3 da Router handlerlarni tartibli boshqarish uchun ishlatiladi.\nOldin barcha kodlar bitta faylda yozilar edi. Katta botlarda bu juda tartibsiz bo‘lib ketadi.\nRouter yordamida:\n",
    "content": "### Dars Konspekti\n\n## Router nima?\nAiogram 3 da Router handlerlarni tartibli boshqarish uchun ishlatiladi.\nOldin barcha kodlar bitta faylda yozilar edi. Katta botlarda bu juda tartibsiz bo‘lib ketadi.\nRouter yordamida:\n- start komandalar\n- admin qismi\n- user qismi\n- callbacklar\n- state lar\nalohida fayllarga ajratiladi.\n\n---\n\n\n# Router nima uchun kerak?\n\n## Afzalliklari\n\n### 1. Kod tartibli bo‘ladi\nHar bir bo‘lim alohida faylda yoziladi.\n\n---\n\n\n### 2. Katta loyihalar qilish oson\n1000 qatorli bitta fayl bo‘lib ketmaydi.\n\n---\n\n\n### 3. Team bilan ishlash qulay\nHar bir dasturchi o‘z qismi bilan ishlaydi.\n\n---\n\n\n### 4. Xatolarni topish oson\nMuammo qaysi routerda ekanini tez topish mumkin.\n\n---\n\n\n# Router asosiy sintaksisi\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\n\nrouter = Router()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Handler nima?\nHandler — foydalanuvchidan kelgan narsani ushlab oluvchi funksiya.\nMisollar:\n- /start komandasi\n- oddiy text\n- tugma bosilishi\n- rasm yuborilishi\n- callback\nhammasi handler orqali ishlaydi.\n\n---\n\n\n# Papkalar strukturasi\n\n```Plain Text\nproject/\n│\n├── handlers/\n│   ├── start.py\n│   ├── help.py\n│   └── admin.py\n│\n├── keyboards/\n├── states/\n├── database/\n│\n└── main.py\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# 1-qadam — start.py yaratish\n\n## start.py\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\nfrom aiogram.types import Message\nfrom aiogram.filters import CommandStart\n\nrouter = Router()\n\n@router.message(CommandStart())\nasync def start_handler(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(\"Salom\")\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Kod tushuntirishi\n\n## Router yaratish\n\n```Python\nrouter = Router()\n```\nBu yangi router yaratadi.\n\n---\n\n\n## Message handler\n\n```Python\n@router.message(CommandStart())\n```\nBu /start komandasi kelganda ishlaydi.\n\n---\n\n\n## Userga javob yuborish\n\n```Python\nawait message.answer(\"Salom\")\n```\nBot foydalanuvchiga xabar yuboradi.\n\n---\n\n\n# 2-qadam — help.py yaratish\n\n## help.py\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\nfrom aiogram.types import Message\nfrom aiogram.filters import Command\n\nrouter = Router()\n\n@router.message(Command(\"help\"))\nasync def help_handler(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(\"Yordam bo'limi\")\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# 3-qadam — main.py\n\n## main.py\n\n```Python\nimport asyncio\nfrom aiogram import Bot, Dispatcher\n\nfrom handlers.start import router as start_router\nfrom handlers.help import router as help_router\n\nTOKEN = \"TOKEN\"\n\nbot = Bot(token=TOKEN)\ndp = Dispatcher()\n\n# Routerlarni ulash\n\ndp.include_router(start_router)\ndp.include_router(help_router)\n\nasync def main():\n    await dp.start_polling(bot)\n\nasyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# include_router nima?\n\n```Python\ndp.include_router(start_router)\n```\nBu:\n“Routerni botga ulash”\ndegan ma’noni beradi.\nAgar include_router qilinmasa handler ishlamaydi.\n\n---\n\n\n# Bir nechta router ishlatish\nAiogram 3 da cheksiz router ishlatish mumkin.\nMasalan:\n\n```Python\ndp.include_router(start_router)\ndp.include_router(admin_router)\ndp.include_router(user_router)\ndp.include_router(payment_router)\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Oddiy message handler\n\n```Python\n@router.message()\nasync def echo(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(message.text)\n```\nBu user yuborgan textni qaytarib yuboradi.\n\n---\n\n\n# Filter bilan ishlash\n\n## Text filter\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import F\n\n@router.message(F.text == \"salom\")\nasync def hello(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(\"Va alaykum assalom\")\n```\nAgar user salom yozsa bot javob beradi.\n\n---\n\n\n# Callback handler\nInline tugmalar uchun ishlatiladi.\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram.types import CallbackQuery\n\n@router.callback_query()\nasync def callback_handler(callback: CallbackQuery):\n    await callback.answer(\"Bosildi\")\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Routerlarda inline tugmalar\n\n## keyboard.py\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram.types import InlineKeyboardMarkup\nfrom aiogram.types import InlineKeyboardButton\n\nmenu = InlineKeyboardMarkup(\n    inline_keyboard=[\n        [\n            InlineKeyboardButton(\n                text=\"Bos\",\n                callback_data=\"click\"\n            )\n        ]\n    ]\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## handler\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router, F\nfrom aiogram.types import Message, CallbackQuery\n\nrouter = Router()\n\n@router.message()\nasync def start(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(\n        \"Menu\",\n        reply_markup=menu\n    )\n\n@router.callback_query(F.data == \"click\")\nasync def click_handler(callback: CallbackQuery):\n    await callback.answer(\"Tugma bosildi\")\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Routerlarda state ishlatish\nState — user holatini saqlash.\nMasalan:\n- ism kiritish\n- telefon olish\n- registratsiya\n- savol-javob\nuchun ishlatiladi.\n\n---\n\n\n# State misol\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram.fsm.state import State, StatesGroup\n\nclass RegisterState(StatesGroup):\n    name = State()\n    age = State()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Routerlarda admin panel\nAdmin funksiyalarni alohida routerga yoziladi.\n\n## admin.py\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\nfrom aiogram.types import Message\nfrom aiogram.filters import Command\n\nrouter = Router()\n\n@router.message(Command(\"admin\"))\nasync def admin_panel(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(\"Admin panel\")\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Routerlar ishlash ketma-ketligi\n1. User message yuboradi\n1. Router message ni ushlab oladi\n1. Handler ishlaydi\n1. Bot javob yuboradi\n\n---\n\n\n# Routerlarda eng ko‘p ishlatiladigan decoratorlar\n\n## Message\n\n```Python\n@router.message()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Callback\n\n```Python\n@router.callback_query()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Edited message\n\n```Python\n@router.edited_message()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Channel post\n\n```Python\n@router.channel_post()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Aiogram 3 muhim importlar\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\nfrom aiogram import F\nfrom aiogram.types import Message\nfrom aiogram.types import CallbackQuery\nfrom aiogram.filters import Command\nfrom aiogram.filters import CommandStart\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Aiogram 2 va Aiogram 3 farqi\n\n## Aiogram 2\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Dispatcher\n\n@dp.message_handler()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Aiogram 3\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\n\n@router.message()\n```\nAiogram 3 da router tizimi ishlatiladi.\n\n---\n\n\n# Dars davomida aytiladigan muhim gaplar\n\n## 1.\nRouter — handlerlarni boshqaruvchi obyekt.\n\n---\n\n\n## 2.\nHandler — userdan kelgan narsani ushlovchi funksiya.\n\n---\n\n\n## 3.\ninclude_router — routerni botga ulash.\n\n---\n\n\n## 4.\nKatta botlarda router juda muhim.\n\n---",
    "homework": "/about komandasi yarating.\nBot:\n\n```Plain Text\nBu test bot\n```\nxabarini yuborsin.\n\n---\n\n\nUser salom yozsa:\n\n```Plain Text\nVa alaykum assalom\n```\nchiqsin.\n\n---\n\n\nInline tugma yarating.\n\n---\n\n\n# Mini loyiha\n\n## start.py\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\nfrom aiogram.types import Message\nfrom aiogram.filters import CommandStart\n\nrouter = Router()\n\n@router.message(CommandStart())\nasync def start_handler(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(\"Bot ishga tushdi\")\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## about.py\n\n```Python\nfrom aiogram import Router\nfrom aiogram.types import Message\nfrom aiogram.filters import Command\n\nrouter = Router()\n\n@router.message(Command(\"about\"))\nasync def about_handler(message: Message):\n    await message.answer(\"Bu test bot\")\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## main.py\n\n```Python\nimport asyncio\nfrom aiogram import Bot, Dispatcher\n\nfrom handlers.start import router as start_router\nfrom handlers.about import router as about_router\n\nTOKEN = \"TOKEN\"\n\nbot = Bot(token=TOKEN)\ndp = Dispatcher()\n\n# Routerlarni ulash\n\ndp.include_router(start_router)\ndp.include_router(about_router)\n\nasync def main():\n    await dp.start_polling(bot)\n\nasyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Eng muhim eslab qolish kerak bo‘lgan joylar\n\n## Router yaratish\n\n```Python\nrouter = Router()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Message handler\n\n```Python\n@router.message()\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Routerni ulash\n\n```Python\ndp.include_router(router)\n```\n\n---\n\n\n# Xulosa\nAiogram 3 da barcha handlerlar router ichida yoziladi.\nRouter:\n- kodni tartibli qiladi\n- katta loyihalarni osonlashtiradi\n- handlerlarni boshqaradi\n- bot arxitekturasini yaxshilaydi\nKatta professional botlar routerlarsiz yozilmaydi.",
